    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSimply oozing potential, this quaint detached farmhouse is tucked away on a quiet by-road, within easy reach of coastal locations, Ballycullane village, Wellingtonbridge and Ramsgrange village. \n\nThe property now presents an excellent opportunity for a new owner to restore and reimagine it to their own taste. It will appeal to those seeking a project in a unique setting. \n\nSet on approximately 2.59 acres, the grounds offer plenty of space and flexibility, with outbuildings and a large shed with lean to, suitable for a variety of uses. \n\nWhile the house is in need of complete renovation, the accommodation currently comprises of an entrance porch, living room, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms with a generous landing area.\n\nA wonderful opportunity for those looking to create a home in a unique and sought-after setting. Early viewing is reccommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 4.3m x 1.5m\nDado rail, tile floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 3.45m\nLaminate floor, fireplace\n\nBedroom One - 4.2m x 1.8m\nLaminate floor, to front\n\nKitchen - 4.3m x 4.2m\nTiled floor, stove, incorporated hot-press\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.8m\nTiled splash back, bath, wc, wash hand basin\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nHall - 4.8m x 1.5m\nWood floor\n\nBedroom Two - 4.5m x 2.7m\nDual aspect windows, wood floor, to front\n\nBedroom Three - 2.9m x 2.75\nTo rear, wood floor\n\nBedroom Four - 4.4m x 3.5m\nWood floor, dual windows, storage\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Variety of stone outbuildings</li><li>Shed 15m x 9m with lean to</li><li>Set on 3.95 acres</li><li>Huge Potential</li><li>Just 5 minutes from Tintern Abbey</li><li>3kms from Ballycullane village and 9kms from Wellingtonbridge</ul>"
      },
